CREATED:20260319T182303Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260320T190336Z
UID:10016999-1777726800-1777737600@www.ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Field Sketching with Color
DESCRIPTION:Field Sketching with Color\nwith Dayna Walton \nSaturday\, May 2  |  1 – 4pm \nREGISTER HERE \nJoin Dayna Walton of Solstice Handmade for a workshop exploring sketching nature from life using colored ballpoint pens. Portable and vivid\, pen sketching is great for those interested in drawing on the trail. We will cover foundational techniques such as color theory\, mark making\, creating textures\, and planning compositions\, then head outdoors to practice our new skills. \nThis class is open to any experience level\, and all the supplies you’ll need are included. \nThis program will take place outside and will follow easy trails and paved walkways. Dress for the weather and prepare to be outside for the entire program time. \nDayna Walton came to love WNC through the Artist-in-Residence program of the Great Smoky Mountains National Park in 2019. Since then\, she’s been hiking and sketching and learning about ecology wherever she can. Her illustrations are her way of studying the creepy\, crawly\, tiny\, often overlooked parts of nature. From slime molds and stoneflies\, to lichens and liverworts\, you’re sure to recognize some species from the Blue Ridge Mountains in her work. \n\nMembers: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions.\nSee a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs.\nWe are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide.\nFollow us on Facebook & Instagram!\nJoin our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord!\nInterested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here.\n\nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://www.ncarboretum.org/event/field-sketching-with-color-2/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/IMG_6388-2-1-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
