DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260504T130000
SUMMARY:Earth Whispering
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\nWhat if the Earth isn’t so
 mething you walk on… but something you are in constant conversation with
 ?\n\n**Earth Whispering** is an invitation to step beyond trying to figure
  life out and into perceiving\, receiving\, and creating with the planet i
 tself. Not as an idea. Not as a concept. But as a living\, breathing\, awa
 re presence that is already communicating with you—if you’re willing t
 o listen.\n\nIn this class\, we invite you to the *how* to connect to the 
 Earth while unraveling everything that tells you that you can’t.\n\nWhat
  awareness are you already having about the land\, the animals\, the mushr
 ooms\, the elements… that you’ve been dismissing as imagination\, coin
 cidence\, or “just a feeling”? What if that’s actually your greatest
  capacity?\n\nThis is not about becoming more spiritual.\nIt’s about bec
 oming more **you**.\n\nThrough simple\, pragmatic tools and energetic invi
 tations\, you’ll begin to:\n\n* Recognize the whispers you’ve been ign
 oring\n* Trust the awareness your body and being are already receiving\n* 
 Engage with the Earth as a co-creative partner\n* Shift from forcing chang
 e… to *inviting life to grow vibrantly*\n\nWhat if the Earth responds to
  you?\nWhat if your presence changes the land?\nWhat if the future the pla
 net is asking for… requires *you*?\n\nYou don’t have to get it right.\
 nYou don’t have to believe in anything.\n\nYou just have to be willing t
 o notice.\nBecause the Earth is already whispering.\nThe question is — w
 ill you listen?\n\nRegistration: https://www.consciousbeing.institute/even
 t-details/earth-whispering
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/access-consciousness-asheville/events
 /314551769/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260429T234649Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260429T234649Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
