BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Riverartsdistrict": "https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/the-gardener-movie-screening/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:riverartsdistrict
X-SOURCE:River Arts District
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260506T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260506T210000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232001
CREATED:20260428T003248Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260428T003337Z
UID:10035967-1778094000-1778101200@www.riverartsdistrict.com
SUMMARY:The Gardener Movie Screening
DESCRIPTION:After the loss of her husband and father\, Sabena Weathers (Radha Mitchell) fights to preserve her family’s cosmetics empire while facing a hostile takeover. Seeking refuge\, she retreats to a remote mountaintop garden cottage\, where a chance encounter with a simple gardener (William Miller) sparks a powerful journey of love\, self-discovery\, and transformation. Rooted in quiet mystery and emotional truth\, THE GARDENER explores loss\, healing\, and the courage to realize one’s true self. \nLOCAL CONNECTIONS \nMuch of the movie was filmed locally in Franklin and Highlands\, NC. In addition\, a local creative team worked together to produce the book. The book is the vision of Director Dabney Day\, and was co-designed by Dabney and local RADA artist/designer Andrea Kulish Wilhelm. The book was illustrated with gorgeous original watercolor paintings by Asheville RADA artist\, Olga Dorenko\, was printed locally by Rocky Kenworthy at Dot Editions\, and the binding was done by Kimberly Obee of Wishing Flower Press and Bindery in Black Mountain. The Gardener will screen at the Fine Arts Theater in Asheville on May 6. Writer/Director/Producer Dabney Day will be in attendance and will have a Q& A at the end. https://www.thegardenermovie.com/
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/the-gardener-movie-screening/
LOCATION:Fine Arts Theatre\, 36 Biltmore Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/full_Poster_TG_27x40_v18_FINAL_RGB_Low.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Andrea Kulish":MAILTO:andreakulish@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
