SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Trey Crispin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 8th\nEvening Dance
  Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nLIVE M
 USIC w/ Trey Crispin & Friends \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\nIntention: T
 BA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. Th
 e doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be tu
 rned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*
 \nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for l
 ack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.
 ../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNyd
 GMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1R
 n7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need
  volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[htt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam1
 0YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgU
 cbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT A
 NNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. P
 lease note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreem
 ents:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZW
 Q0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAE
 Tf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n
 \nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves i
 n harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving 
 community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy com
 munity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and com
 munity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocat
 ion: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
