SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ SeigeA
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 10th\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Faci
 litator SeigeA\nIntention: TBA\n\nSunday\, May 10th\n\n1st Dance Wave 8:30
 \\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave 10:30\
 \-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ SeigeA\n\nIntenti
 on: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly) has been creating ecstati
 c dance waves for the Asheville community since 2014. Their eclectic mix o
 f musical styles beckons dancers into new patterns of movement and express
 ion through diverse time signatures and instrumentation\, and a wide range
  of musical and emotive qualities. CJ's waves explore high peaks\, beautif
 ul vistas\, juicy lowlands and the profound reflective stillness of tranqu
 il water. CJ's dance waves are pre-produced and refined through the body a
 nd ears of a dancer and audiophile. Find more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves a
 t [https://dj.seigea.com](https://dj.seigea.com/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAA
 YnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2RYVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7_kL
 Zb02C0GtEJZq7DNA0VDNNL4tpCKWsNg1SWy5-UKvBESv4lXcjFt4AnpA_aem_MZ9LvDpfu8arW
 Q_ujtMuiA)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at War
 m up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive lat
 e will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure conta
 iner. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned aw
 ay for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteer
 s. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevi
