SUMMARY:Symphony Taster: Where Magical Beings Play
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\n**Symphony Taster: Where Mag
 ical Beings Play**\nWhat if magical beings aren’t something to believe i
 n—but something you can perceive? In this Symphony Taster\, you’re inv
 ited into a different space of awareness\, where connection isn’t define
 d\, categorized\, or controlled. What are you aware of that doesn’t matc
 h anything you’ve been taught is real? And what if that’s not wrong?\n
 \nThrough presence\, energy\, and question\, you’ll begin to sense what 
 else is here\, waiting to be noticed. What if friendship with magical bein
 gs doesn’t require effort\, only allowance? What becomes possible when y
 ou stop trying to figure it out and start playing instead? Inspired by the
  Sasquatch and other magical beings that dwell with us on this planet with
  us — this session opens space for:\n✨ Greater clarity\n✨ Ease of Co
 mmunication\n✨ Inner spaciousness\n✨ The gift of being witnessed witho
 ut judgment\n\nOnly curiosity.\nCome taste the Symphony.\n\nNo musical exp
 erience required - the symphony referenced the energies that one learns at
  Dr. Dain Heer's class Symphony of Possibilities that I will be using to d
 eliver this session to those that sign up. This is a Symphony Group Taster
 \n\nCome discover the space where magic isn’t separate from you\, and yo
 u are already friends with all creatures on Planet Earth and beyond.\n\nRe
 gistration: https://www.consciousbeing.institute/event-details/symphony-ta
 ster-where-magical-beings-play
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/access-consciousness-asheville/events
 /314552090/
