BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Riverartsdistrict": "https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/pyrography-wood-burning-with-chalkley-matlact/2026-05-14/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:riverartsdistrict
X-SOURCE:River Arts District
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T180000
DTSTAMP:20260501T232001
CREATED:20250214T220835Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251231T171359Z
UID:10035317-1778774400-1778781600@www.riverartsdistrict.com
SUMMARY:Pyrography – Wood Burning with Chalkley Matlack
DESCRIPTION:All levels. Adults and children 12+ with adult supervision. \nThis workshop will teach you the basic safety and techniques to begin your journey with pyrography. The woodburning tool will feel cumbersome at first\, but the lesson at the first half of the workshop will help you understand the different ways to utilize factors like angles\, speed\, and pressure to get the desired effect with the tool. After some practice\, in the second half of the class you will create a piece of art on a beautiful piece of bass wood. You will take home the woodburning tool provided to continue your pyrography journey. \nGoals:\n-Learn how to safely operate pyrography tools\n-Practice the many ways to use the tool for different techniques\n-Be in a creative environment with people working on a common goal\n-Create a piece of pyrography art to take home with you. \nMaterials Provided:\n-Beginner’s woodburning tool\, which you will take home with you\n-Practice Panel\n-Final artwork Panel\, Bark Edge (7x12in)\n-Carbon transfer paper for transferring your image onto the wood \nStudent Provides:\n-A printed image to transfer onto the wood\, the final panel is 7x12in wide so if you use a standard 8.5×11 sheet of printer paper\, be sure to size your image to fit within the dimensions\n-Gardening/work gloves (if you’re concerned about possible burns)\n-Pencil or Pen \nBring a snack and beverage if you wish. \nContact Chalkley if you have questions – chalkleynmatlack@gmail.com \nRegistration: $125 (includes supplies)
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/pyrography-wood-burning-with-chalkley-matlact/2026-05-14/
LOCATION:Trackside Studios\, 375 Depot Street\, Asheville\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/pyro-example-02-Chalkley-Matlack.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Trackside Studios":MAILTO:tracksidestudios375@gmail.com
GEO:35.5805429;-82.5646109
