SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Karen Funshine
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 15th\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest
  DJ Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator TBA\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nKa
 ren Funshine (Karen Smith) has been dancing since age 3\, with movement as
  her lifelong ally. A veteran raver & EDM enthusiast\, she was delighted t
 o discover 5Rhythms and ecstatic dance 10 years ago in Austin - a sober an
 d judgment-free space to get wild & free. She’s since facilitated many w
 omen’s conscious dance circles and a vibrant live-instrument dance - wea
 ving music and somatic movement to alchemize emotion\, open the heart\, an
 d awaken joy. Recently relocated to Asheville\, Karen is honored to share 
 her passion and playfulness with her beautiful new community through the u
 niversal language of music and dance.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note t
 hat the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circl
 e and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure 
 a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your
  price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recomme
 nded:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https:
 //ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMT
 AAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60
 jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8
 PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for fr
 ee! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vo
 lunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0
 bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMD
 A4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_n
 rjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the
  beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRC
 LE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
 zOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv
 2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collec
 tive envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be thei
 r authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to i
 nspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosti
 ng dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(
 3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\
 n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/314187698/
