SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 24th\n1st Dance Wa
 ve 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave
  10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Facili
 tator Rory Jagdeo\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nRory Jagdeo is a sing
 er/songwriter and an AMC Facilitator. He stepped into Ecstatic Dance in Ho
 uston\, TX for the first time in 2014 and believes in the power of dance t
 o transform and bring a healthier\, happier\, and connected lifestyle. It 
 is that driving force and passion that pushes him to explore the role of b
 eing an Ecstatic Dance Facilitator using world rhythms and different music
 al genres to weave mixes that incorporate many elements of 8Rhythms. Liste
 n to his mixes at: https://soundcloud.com/roryjagdeo. And his music at: ht
 tps://roryjagdeo.bandcamp.com/releases\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note 
 that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circ
 le and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to en
 sure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name y
 our price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-regi
 stration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nV
 OLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to v
 olunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZB
 ExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_d
 JGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--
 PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the 
 opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\n
 Collective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance
 /](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0
 CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAA
 R5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2
 JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a w
 orld that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves
  within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticit
 y and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for
  personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organ
 ization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
