 lves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authent
 icity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves
  for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit o
 rganization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on 
 the dance floor!
