SUMMARY:Black Business Alliance - Getting Capital-Ready
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260611T190000
UID:658f9de838875e53d503310b404fca30@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:We're excited to launch the Access to Capital Accelerator Seri
 es \, designed to equip minority-owned and small businesses with the knowl
 edge\, connections and tools needed to successfully access funding. This m
 onth's session\, Getting Capital-Ready \, will feature a few of our local 
 banks\, credit unions\, and community partners who will walk us through fi
 nancial readiness. Points covered will include Required documentation Loan
